    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 12,
    "t1": 16,
    "text": "You're driving a molecular machine inside a video. This is Flow Video."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "4",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 16,
    "t1": 20,
    "text": "Questions? Ask out loud. It answers from this lesson."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "5",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 20,
    "t1": 25,
    "text": "And when the story forks… you pick the road."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "6",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "LIVE-WINDOW",
    "window": "solarSystem",
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 25,
    "t1": 33,
    "text": "Round two — a solar system. Tap any planet. Go ahead… I'll wait."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "7",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 33,
    "t1": 36,
    "text": "There you go. You flew… and the video never stopped."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "8",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 36,
    "t1": 45,
    "text": "Want one? Drop in footage — and anything interactive. Tell the AI what viewers touch. No code. One link. That's a Flow Video."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "9",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "LIVE-WINDOW",
    "window": "murmuration",
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 45,
    "t1": 52,
    "text": "Last one. Steer the flock… then hit Scatter."
  },
  {
    "film": 1,
    "scene": "10",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 52,
    "t1": 58,
    "text": "That was you. Now pick what's next. — Touch it. Ask it. Steer it. — Flow Video."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "1",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 0,
    "t1": 6,
    "text": "Remember the solar system? You're about to build it — start to share. No code. Watch."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "2",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 6,
    "t1": 13,
    "text": "New project… and drop everything in at once — footage, images, audio, and a whole simulation, as one zip."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "3",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 13,
    "t1": 19,
    "text": "It sorts itself. That zip? Someone's folder — or one already in your Library. No code."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "4",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 19,
    "t1": 27,
    "text": "Find the moment your video should come alive… and drag across it. That's a section."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "5",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 27,
    "t1": 35,
    "text": "Pick Simulation. Choose your package. Then, in plain words — what's this moment for?"
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "6",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 35,
    "t1": 43,
    "text": "Give viewers the planets — let them speed up time and fly to any world."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "7",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "VIDEO",
    "window": null,
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 43,
    "t1": 51,
    "text": "Two switches. Simple UI — only your buttons. Auto Script — it performs for the ones who only watch. …Generate."
  },
  {
    "film": 2,
    "scene": "8",
    "role": "narrator",
    "kind": "LIVE-WINDOW",
    "window": "solarSystem",
    "cont": false,
    "t0": 51,
    "t1": 57,
    "text": "Done. …That's not a preview. Tap a planet."
